# PlantUML: PlantUML Language Reference Guide; requirements/languages/plantuml.md
name     plantuml puml uml
keyword  @startuml @enduml participant actor boundary control entity database collections queue class
keyword  interface abstract enum package namespace note left right of over end as alt else opt loop
keyword  group activate deactivate title skinparam start stop if then endif while endwhile usecase
line-comment   '
block-comment  /' '/
string   " "
operators  ->.:|*+#-<>=
ident-extra    @
